:: Office Security Escort
<<generate1>><<person1>>
<<if $avery_fate is "ascended">><<location "avery_skyscraper">><<else>><<location "office">><</if>><<effects>>
경비원인 <<person>>【이가】 당신의 팔을 거칠게 붙잡고 로비 뒤쪽에 있는 경비실로 끌고 간다.
<br>
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
    <<His>> 억센 손아귀와 빠른 걸음걸이 때문에 당신은 자신의 <<lewdness>>【을를】 가릴 수 없다.
    <br>
<</if>>
<<if $officecomplaints lte 3>>
    <<officecomplaintslow>>
<<elseif $officecomplaints lte 6>>
    <<officecomplaintsmedium>>
<<elseif $officecomplaints lte 9>>
    <<officecomplaintshigh>>
<<else>>
    <<officecomplaintsextreme>>
<</if>>

:: Office Security Spank
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<maninit>><<npcspank>><<set $enemyhealth to 600>><<set $enemyhealthmax to 600>><<set $enemyanger += 200>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<<set $enemyanger -= 75>>
	<</if>>
	<<He>>【은는】 당신을 책상 위로 구부린다.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<effects>>

<<effectsman>><<man>>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

